text @[Tomoya]
text I don't think we lost. Probably...
text I genuinely didn't know whether we won or not.
text I can't remember anything after flying at the soccer club members.
text All I can recall from there are vague images.
text But my fist hurts a lot, so I must have been doing a lot of punching.
text And there's blood sticking down the back of my throat, so they must have been doing a lot of punching, too.
text But how exactly the whole thing ended, I don't know.
text "You guys are crazy." I could hear the club members spouting such lines as they retreated.
text Even if we wanted to follow after them, our legs won't move at all.
text All I remember is me, continuing to glare at their backs as they left on unsteady feet.
