text @[Mei]
text Please... stop...
text At this point, neither of us can hear Mei-chan's delicate voice.
text @[Tomoya]
text You filthy idiot!
text Sunohara's face received the full brunt of my headbutt.
text He staggers backward, holding his nose, and I jump him, pinning him to the ground.
text @[Tomoya]
text Sunohara! Don't screw with me!
text I sit on top of him and grab him by his blond hair.
text @[Tomoya]
text Just what do you think Mei-chan has been going through, all because of you!?
text I punch him with everything I have.
text @[Tomoya]
text Just... how miserable do you think she's been?!
text Two, three times, I strike him clean in the face.
text @[Tomoya]
text It's all because of you!
text @[Tomoya]
text Why can't you just get your act straight?!
text @[Tomoya]
text Aren't you her Onii-chan?!
text His wounds are opening up again, and blood is now pouring from his forehead and nose.
text @[Tomoya]
text Apologize...!
text @[Tomoya]
text Apologize... to Mei-chan...!
text The blood gushing out scatters onto the sports grounds, dying it a deep black.
