text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text I look at them for a short while.
text Before long, I stand back up.
text I'm covered in mud, and there's blood spattered everywhere. It's a horrible sight.
text I fix my sandy, disheveled hair a bit.
text I'll need to take a shower once I get back.
text I'll also have to get my spare uniform out of my closet.
text And what am I gonna eat for dinner...?
text These are the kinds of things I absentmindedly find myself thinking.
text I put my hands in my pockets and turn to leave.
text After walking for a short while, I look back over my shoulder.
text I see the brother and sister holding each other tightly.
text I breathe out a single sigh...
text And once again, I slowly start walking.
