text We leave the classroom together.
text As I talk to him, I almost feel like I'm about to go crazy and burst into laughter again.
text That's right. That's the relationship we two have.
text There's nothing to be worried or uneasy about, let alone to be truly troubled about.
text The resentment that had been lurking in my heart all this time.
text I could feel it melting away, as if it had all been a lie.
