text ...Two years ago.
text I passed by some guy in the hallway.
text He was a strange, blond guy.
text And his face was even stranger. Just looking at him made me burst into laughter.
text It was the first time I'd laughed since I'd come to this school.
text "Aah, I want to laugh like this far, far more," I thought to myself.
text I was truly happy for it.
text I'd found a small bit of happiness here.
text I figured I should try acting stupid with that guy.
text And when I did, it really was incredibly fun.
text Again, I was able to laugh just like before.
text It was so much fun, and I was so happy.
text No matter what, we laughed.
text And, even now, we are...
